Clean up the console

find settings on the left hand side (the cog)
scroll down untill you find "console"
Add a filter, in the box that appears

Name-         Hide Metadata
Type-         Starts with
Starts with-  //metadata
  SAVE it

Add another filter, in the box that appears

Name-         Hide Probe Measurement
Type-         starts with
Starts with-  //probe at
  SAVE it

Add another filter, in the box that appears

Name-         Hide Probe Points
Type-         Expression
Expression-   ^// [0-9]+\s+\|
  SAVE it

Add another filter, in the box that appears

Name-         Hide Extraction Progress
Type-         Starts with
Starts with-  // [virtual_sdcard] extraction_progress:
  SAVE it

	
I have added quite a few more filters to clean the console up massivley, it now just shows the important stuff and so much more readable. 
If there any others that you want filtered, just follow the same format.
There are too many to put in this copy and paste text file.
However i have shared my .json file of the settings. Down load it and apply it to your own settings page.



If you press the cog within the console you can turn them on and off via the check boxes.
